@"ModelTest_Polar_31_Coords.txt"       NumCoords   ! The number of coordinates in the airfoil shape file. Set to zero if coordinates not included.
AF31_BL.txt              BL_file     ! The file name including the boundary layer characteristics of the profile. Ignored if the aeroacoustic module is not called.
